(1) 设三辆汽车发生事故的事件分别为 $A_1$，$A_2$，$A_3$，则

$$
P(\overline{A_1}\overline{A_2}\overline{A_3})
=\frac{8}{9}\cdot\frac{9}{10}\cdot\frac{10}{11}
=\frac{8}{11}
$$

所以一年内至少有一辆汽车发生事故，即单位获赔的概率为

$$
1-\frac{8}{11}=\frac{3}{11}
$$

(2) 因为各车是否发生事故相互独立，所以

$$
P(\xi=0)=\frac{8}{11}
$$


$$
P(\xi=9000)
=\frac{1}{9}\cdot\frac{9}{10}\cdot\frac{10}{11}
 +\frac{8}{9}\cdot\frac{1}{10}\cdot\frac{10}{11}
 +\frac{8}{9}\cdot\frac{9}{10}\cdot\frac{1}{11}
=\frac{11}{45}
$$


$$
P(\xi=18000)
=\frac{1}{9}\cdot\frac{1}{10}\cdot\frac{10}{11}
 +\frac{1}{9}\cdot\frac{9}{10}\cdot\frac{1}{11}
 +\frac{8}{9}\cdot\frac{1}{10}\cdot\frac{1}{11}
=\frac{3}{110}
$$


$$
P(\xi=27000)
=\frac{1}{9}\cdot\frac{1}{10}\cdot\frac{1}{11}
=\frac{1}{990}
$$

获赔金额的分布列为
\begin{center}
\begin{tabular}{c|cccc}
$\xi$ & $0$ & $9000$ & $18000$ & $27000$ \\
\hline
$P$ & $\frac{8}{11}$ & $\frac{11}{45}$ & $\frac{3}{110}$ & $\frac{1}{990}$
\end{tabular}
\end{center}
因此

$$
E(\xi)=0\cdot\frac{8}{11}
 +9000\cdot\frac{11}{45}
 +18000\cdot\frac{3}{110}
 +27000\cdot\frac{1}{990}
=\frac{29900}{11}\text{ 元}
$$
